# Inactive proposal. No generation/configuration is authorized under this hold.
# Use actual configured native headers and the existing kernel ffi aliases.
# kuid_t/uid_t are real by-value types; every aggregate pointee remains opaque.
--no-doc-comments
--no-default '.*'
--allowlist-type 'user_struct|kmem_cache|hlist_head|kuid_t|uid_t|size_t'
--opaque-type 'user_struct|kmem_cache|hlist_head'
--allowlist-function 'lupos_user_accounting_.*'
--allowlist-var 'LUPOS_USER_ACCOUNTING_.*'
# Native initcall_t remains entirely in C. The Rust init body is reached by
# a direct int(void) call from the native __init trampoline. Do not invent
# contextual KCFI encodings. Generated ABI/CFI identities require qualification.
